      602.35,
      555.08,
      693.7
    ],
    "text": "For tonight: Showers will occur at times in Western, Sabaragamuwa and North-western provinces and in Kandy, Nuwara-Eliya, Galle and Matara districts. Heavy falls above 100 mm are likely at some places. For tomorrow: Showers will occur at times in Sabaragamuwa province and in Kandy and Nuwara-Eliya districts. Fairly heavy falls above 50 mm are likely at some places in these areas.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      0.9599999785423279,
      6.960000038146973,
      12.0
