      857.98
    ],
    "text": "Strong winds of about (40-50) kmph can be expected at times over Western, Sabaragamuwa, Southern, North-central, Central and North-western provinces and in Mannar, Trincomalee and Monaragala districts.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
